rite_globs":["index.html"],"constraints":["Page background and canvas clear color #060913; body margin 0, overflow hidden.","One <canvas id=\"sim\"> filling the full window (position fixed, 100vw x 100vh); backing store sized to innerWidth*devicePixelRatio x innerHeight*devicePixelRatio with ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0); re-sized on window resize.","Animation loop uses requestAnimationFrame with delta time (clamp dt to 0.05 s); simulation advances by dt*app.speed only while app.running is true; rendering continues while paused.","Central star at canvas center drawn with ctx.createRadialGradient (white core -> #ffd27a -> #ff8a3d -> transparent) plus a corona whose radius/alpha pulses subtly with a sine of time.","At least 5 planets in app.planets, each object with fields radius (orbit radius), speed (angular speed), color, size, angle; orbit radii distinct (scale to min(width,height)), speeds distinct (inner faster), colors distinct, e.g. #9fb4c7, #e8b86d, #4fa3ff, #ff6b4a, #d9a066, #7fe0d0.","At least 3 moons in app.moons, each with fields parent (index into planets), radius, speed, size, color, angle; moons orbit their parent planet.","Faint thin orbit circle per planet (rgba white alpha ~0.06).","Fading orbital trails: each planet keeps a history array of recent positions (~60 points) drawn as a line whose alpha fades from 0 at the tail to ~0.6 at the head; trails drawn only when app.trails is true; history cleared when trails turned off and on Reset.","Background starfield in app.stars with at least 200 stars, each with x, y, size, phase, twinkle speed; alpha oscillates with sin(time*twinkle+phase) so they twinkle.","Click (mousedown/click) on the canvas spawns a radial burst of 40-60 glowing particles at the click point in app.particles; each particle has x, y, vx, vy, life, color; velocities spread evenly around 360 degrees with random magnitude; each frame velocity multiplied by a damping factor (~0.96 per 1/60 s, frame-rate independent), life decreases and alpha = life; removed when life <= 0 (lifetime ~1.5-2.5 s). Draw with globalCompositeOperation 'lighter' and a small radial glow.","HUD: a fixed panel at top-left, id \"hud\", glassmorphism: background rgba(255,255,255,0.08), backdrop-filter: blur(12px) (plus -webkit-backdrop-filter), border 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18), border-radius 14px, padding 14px 16px, color #e6ecff, system-ui font, subtle box-shadow; pointer events on HUD must not spawn bursts.","HUD button id=\"btnPlay\": toggles app.running; label reads 'Pause' while running and 'Play' while paused.","HUD button id=\"btnTrails\": toggles app.trails; label 'Trails: ON' / 'Trails: OFF'.","HUD button id=\"btnReset\": sets app.simTime=0, clears app.particles, resets planet and moon angles to initial values, clears trail histories (keeps current speed, running and trails state).","Exactly this slider: <input type=\"range\" id=\"speed\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"3.0\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.0\">; on 'input' event sets app.speed = parseFloat(value); readout span id=\"speedVal\" shows e.g. '1.0x' (value.toFixed(1)+'x').","Live stats: span id=\"fps\" (integer FPS, smoothed, updated a few times per second), span id=\"simTime\" (app.simTime.toFixed(1) + ' s'), span id=\"particleCount\" (app.particles.length), updated every frame.","Buttons styled translucent (rgba(255,255,255,0.1) background, 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.25) border, border-radius 8px, hover brighter), arranged in a row; stats in a small monospace grid below.","Expose window.app = { running, trails, speed, simTime, fps, planets, moons, stars, particles } as the live state object (same object mutated by the simulation, not copies)."],"verify_commands":["tandem:ui_test {\"steps\":[{\"exists\":\"canvas#sim\"},{\"exists\":\"#hud\"},{\"js\":\"window.app && app.planets.length>=5 && app.moons.length>=3 && app.stars.length>=150 && new Set(app.planets.map(p=>p.radius)).size===app.planets.length && new Set(app.planets.map(p=>p.color)).size===app.planets.length\"},{\"expect\":\"moving\"},{\"js\":\"app.running===true && app.trails===true && app.speed===1\"},{\"click\":\"#btnPlay\"},{\"js\":\"app.running===false\"},{\"text\":\"#btnPlay\",\"match\":\"Play\"},{\"click\":\"#btnPlay\"},{\"js\":\"app.running===true\"},{\"click\":\"#btnTrails\"},{\"js\":\"app.trails===false\"},{\"text\":\"#btnTrails\",\"match\":\"OFF\"},{\"input\":\"#speed\",\"value\":\"2.5\"},{\"js\":\"app.speed===2.5\"},{\"text\":\"#speedVal\",\"match\":\"2\\\\.5\"},{\"click\":\"canvas#sim\"},{\"js\":\"app.particles.length>=20\"},{\"click\":\"#btnReset\"},{\"js\":\"app.particles.length===0 && app.simTime<1\"}]}"]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":821,"cache_read_input_tokens":14332,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":821},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8594970b-b8ba-4e16-9321-f2bcbb1128cf","uuid":"96431fa3-91d2-4f2d-a0bd-695d8286c602","timestamp":"2026-11-22T00:22:55.070Z","request_id":"req_011ChH1fEv6K1wcDoFQeGjYU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UYstun1mxLjLuwVteb1iox":{"goal":"Create a single self-contained index.html: an interactive full-viewport HTML5 Canvas orbital particle simulation in dark space, with a glassmorphism HUD. Zero external dependencies (no CDN, no fonts, no images), all CSS and JS inline, valid JavaScript.","workspace":"/home/ale/Projects/tandem-mcp/benchmarks/opus/runs/20261121-215741_v3/workspaces/gen_orbital__p3__tandem","write_globs":["index.html"],"constraints":["Page background and canvas clear color #060913; body margin 0, overflow hidden.","One <canvas id=\"sim\"> filling the full window (position fixed, 100vw x 100vh); backing store sized to innerWidth*devicePixelRatio x innerHeight*devicePixelRatio with ctx